"Click to walk through cleared floor only. Nothing is picked up or activated.":"点击后只经空地安全步行，不拾取物品、不触发机关。",
"Impassable wall.":"墙壁不可通行。",
"Pick up 1 gold key by a deliberate adjacent move.":"用方向键踏入，拾取 1 把金钥匙。",
"Recover 70 HP when picked up.":"拾取后恢复 70 生命。",
"Gain 5 ATK when picked up.":"拾取后增加 5 攻击。",
"Gain 4 DEF when picked up.":"拾取后增加 4 防御。",
