"Reward: 60 gold. Overdue debt is paid before spare gold remains.":"奖励 60 金币。若有到期欠款，会先还债，余款入袋。",
"Reward: 5 ATK.":"奖励：攻击 +5。",
"Reward: 140 HP and 1 focus, up to capacity.":"奖励：生命 +140，专注 +1（不超过上限）。",
"Reward: 10 ATK and 45 gold. Guarded treasure can be revisited.":"奖励：攻击 +10、金币 +45。可成长后回来挑战守卫。",
"One core: repair the lift and power calibration, forge +8 DEF, or sell for 35 gold.":"机关芯只能用一次：修电梯并供能校准、锻造防御 +8，或卖 35 金币。",
"Piercer costs 60 gold for +12 ATK. Borrowing is a separate explicit choice.":"穿刺武器：60 金币换攻击 +12。贷款须单独主动选择。",
"Ilen handles the survey and Mira's return. Talk manually; no automatic hand-in.":"伊莲负责样本和米拉返乡任务。须主动交谈，不会自动交付。",
"Read a calibration clue here. The optional Watch oath is a separate choice.":"这里可读校准线索；守望誓约是另一项可选决定。",
"The lift works only after repairing it with the core. It connects floors 1 and 3.":"须用机关芯修复电梯，才可往返第 1、3 层。",
"Forge the core for +8 DEF, or use the survey to build the old flood bridge.":"可用机关芯锻造防御 +8，或交样本修建旧塔水桥。",
"Calibration requires three read clues and the repaired lift. Inspect to reason from your clues.":"校准需要读过三条线索并修好电梯；查看后根据已知线索推理。",
"Bring the sample to J for gold or focus training, or to F for a flood bridge.":"样本可交 J 换金币或专注训练，也可交 F 修水桥，互相排斥。",
"Drain the water to reach the relic, or take +120 HP. A survey bridge can preserve both routes.":"可排水去拿遗物，或饮泉恢复 120 生命。样本修桥可保留两项收益。",
"Choose one relic: heavy buckler or duelist gear. The other choice is lost.":"重盾与决斗装只能选一件，另一件将放弃。",
"80 gold opens expedition bridges once. Supply-label deduction is a separate optional task.":"80 金币一次开启远征桥；验货签推理是另一项可选任务。",
"Choose one route permanently: a rescue shortcut or the siege maul armory. Inspect before choosing.":"救援捷径与攻城锤装备库永久二选一；先查看后果再决定。",
"Step onto Mira to rescue her. Choose her future at J or U before defeating Z.":"手动走到米拉身边救人；击败 Z 前去 J 或 U 选择她的去向。",
"Passable only after draining at O or building the survey bridge at F. Click walking does not cross water.":"在 O 排水或到 F 用样本修桥后可通行；点击步行不会自动过水。",
"Passable after paying for roadworks at Y. Click walking does not cross bridges.":"到 Y 付款修桥后可通行；点击步行不会自动过桥。",
"Use a deliberate adjacent move to change floors. Click walking never uses stairs.":"用方向键主动踏上楼梯才会换层；点击步行不会自动上下楼。",

"Open north gate: rescue Mira without fighting W / siege maul permanently lost":"开北门：免战营救米拉，永久放弃攻城锤",
